1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,880
What do you like and what you don't like about living gree.
住在希腊，你喜欢什么，又不喜欢什么？字幕里的地名是截短的 gree。

2
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:11,800
In general in Europe everything is I think more beautiful and so I just love the the look and feel of the ancient culture the little streets.
总的来说，我觉得欧洲什么都更美。我就喜欢那种古老文化的外观、感觉，还有小街道。

3
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:15,240
Everything is a lot more colorful than for instance in canada.
一切都比加拿大之类的地方更有色彩。

4
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:23,550
I'm very into healthy food with that said you can go to greece and just go to a regular taverna and I feel like it's automatically just like good fresh food.
我很喜欢健康食物。话虽如此，在希腊随便去一家普通小餐馆，我就觉得能吃到新鲜的好食物。

5
00:00:23,560 --> 00:00:30,600
Whereas in the states you kind of have to be very strategic of like I'm going to a vegan gluten free healthy place.
而在美国，你得很有策略地挑，比如我要去素食、无麸质、健康的地方。

6
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:39,800
Uh I like the warm people here I like the daylight the sun people are really generous with word with food with presents with compliments.
我喜欢这里热情的人，也喜欢日光和太阳。大家在言语、食物、礼物和赞美上都很大方。

7
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:46,639
That they're really generous and they share everything very good food unfortunately that make us fat the greek feta.
他们很大方，什么都分享。食物很好吃，可惜会让我们胖起来，还有希腊菲达奶酪。

8
00:00:46,639 --> 00:00:51,600
I know what I just said it's hard about the greek time but it's helping me a lot to slow down.
我知道刚才还说希腊时间难适应，但它确实帮我放慢很多。

9
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:55,840
Because I feel like I'm experiencing life a lot more enjoyably here.
因为我觉得在这里，生活体验愉快多了。

10
00:00:55,840 --> 00:01:02,960
That's what I love about greece is people really take the time to just enjoy and I think that's really important in this life.
我爱希腊的一点，是人们会花时间享受，而我觉得这对生活很重要。

11
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:10,079
Greece has a really rich culture of music concerts are very accessible there's always a lot of live music at restaurants or in squares.
希腊的音乐文化很丰富，音乐会很容易接触到，餐馆和广场经常有现场音乐。

12
00:01:10,079 --> 00:01:14,319
Yes the first thing is the ancient greek history that's why I choose to live here.
对，首先是古希腊历史，这就是我选择住在这里的原因，我很喜欢。

13
00:01:14,319 --> 00:01:23,029
I really love it the second thing the cats I love the cats I always have a cat food in my backpack when I am walking just to feed the cats.
第二是猫。我爱猫，走路时背包里总带猫粮，专门喂猫。

14
00:01:23,039 --> 00:01:30,990
H I love the weather in gree maybe in summer here in at is terrible but you can always be with your t shirt all day.
我喜欢希腊的天气，虽然雅典夏天可能很难熬，但能整天穿 T 恤。

15
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:34,319
I like that it's a very safe country at least comparing with my country.
我觉得这是个很安全的国家，至少和我的国家比起来。

16
00:01:34,319 --> 00:01:42,839
Maria also can walk at any time wherever you go in the greek suburbs it is quite safe for a woman to walk till 12 in the night.
字幕这里称呼 maria，说希腊郊区的女性夜里十二点前走路也挺安全。

17
00:01:42,839 --> 00:01:47,959
When you are living abroad you understand how safe is is athens how safe is greece.
住在国外以后，你才会体会雅典、希腊有多安全。

18
00:01:47,959 --> 00:01:55,080
Well I've been living abroad many many years and the fact that I had to always be indoors to just you know enjoy my guinness but here.
我在国外住了很多很多年，总得待在室内享受我的 Guinness；可是在这里……

19
00:01:55,080 --> 00:02:04,480
You can just go by the beach and you know enjoy the food the view the sunset it's like priceless for me it's a reason you know to move permanently to greece.
可以去海边，享受食物、景色和日落。对我来说无价，也是永久搬来希腊的原因。

20
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:09,719
Also living in greece you get to speak the language of the gods which is the greek language of course.
另外，住在希腊，你就能说众神的语言，当然是希腊语啦。

21
00:02:09,719 --> 00:02:14,240
However ever that also gives some distinct accent unfortunately.
不过，这也会让你有一种独特的口音，可惜了。

22
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:22,350
In terms of what I don't like about greece especially if you go out at night everyone smokes and it's indoors so yeah I'm not crazy about that.
说到不喜欢的，尤其晚上外出，大家都抽烟，还是在室内。我可不太喜欢这一点。

23
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:26,519
I mean people are smoking in the hospital still even now because I'm working the hospital personally.
我的意思是，即便现在，医院里仍有人抽烟，我自己就在医院工作。

24
00:02:26,519 --> 00:02:31,399
I'm frustrated very much from smoking I don't like the smoking in in greece is too much.
我对抽烟非常烦恼，不喜欢希腊的抽烟现象，实在太多。

25
00:02:31,399 --> 00:02:38,000
The bureaucracy is the most problematics I think bureaucracy I think it's just such a big element to your every single day.
办事流程是最麻烦的。我觉得官僚手续就是每天生活里很大的一部分。

26
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:48,160
Whether it comes to documents or literally anything it's such a big part of your life that if you need something done quickly it's is very difficult my brothers got their residency approved.
不管是文件还是任何事，它都占了生活很大部分，要快点办成很难。我的兄弟们居留申请获批了。

27
00:02:48,160 --> 00:02:55,040
In january and it's september and we're still waiting for the papers and they said 2 months so you know.
一月获批，现在九月了，我们还在等文件，可他们说过两个月，你懂的。

28
00:02:55,040 --> 00:03:04,680
I don't like that many people are not efficient I have the feeling that people make their life more complicated and um they are not so structured sometimes I'm missing like the logical thinking.
我不喜欢有些人效率不高。我觉得他们把生活弄复杂了，缺乏条理，有时我会觉得少了逻辑思考。

29
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:09,829
I don't want to say that people don't think logical but I think maybe too emotional often and not structured.
我不想说人们不讲逻辑，但我觉得有时太情绪化，缺乏条理。
